{
    "name": "§bDana Ward",
    "entityType": "easy_npc:humanoid",
    "description": "A cheerleader and student at Blackwell Academy.",
    "skin": {
        "type": "CUSTOM",
        "textureId": "Rachel_Amber_adf7764a"
    },
    "attributes": {
        "maxHealth": 40,
        "invulnerable": false,
        "attackableByPlayers": true,
        "attackableByMonsters": true,
        "nameVisibility": "NEVER"
    },
    "dialogs": {
        "main": {
            "greeting": "嘿！看看这是谁。你是新来的学生吗？Blackwell的欢迎派对总是需要新鲜血液的。保持微笑，自信一点！",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "§6§l接受任务",
                    "action": "OPEN_QUEST_DIALOG:RANDOM_POOL:2ccdf053-eba0-45d1-a3b6-f9c5f7d57d1e,525e1811-7464-4862-8c73-98e62ddc01c3,ffe40186-9cad-4fb6-8993-fc151f8edaac,dbbf8de8-b3fd-4b5a-97fe-b760afea60d3,9c9d86a5-cb15-427a-b314-9db76c47959e",
                    "id": "btn_quest_74b3955f"
                },
                {
                    "label": "你是啦啦队长？",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:story_1",
                    "id": "btn_talk"
                },
                {
                    "label": "最近有什么关于派对的消息吗？",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:quest_intro",
                    "id": "btn_quest"
                }
            ]
        },
        "story_1": {
            "greeting": "当然！Terry的龙卷风队（Terry's Tornadoes）需要有人维持士气。这不仅仅是喊口号，这是关于...影响力。你懂的，如果你想快速融入这里，这是最好的方式。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "听起来很有趣",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:story_2",
                    "id": "btn_next"
                },
                {
                    "label": "我得走了",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_bye"
                }
            ]
        },
        "story_2": {
            "greeting": "是吧？但是最近有点奇怪。我总感觉有人在偷看我们训练，而且储物柜里的东西莫名其妙地不见了。也许是风大的原因？",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "也许我可以帮你留意一下",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:story_3",
                    "id": "btn_help"
                },
                {
                    "label": "别想太多了",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_close"
                }
            ]
        },
        "story_3": {
            "greeting": "真的吗？你太好了！虽然我只是想让大家开心，但如果有人搞破坏，那也太扫兴了。如果你发现什么可疑的，一定要告诉我！",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "我会的！",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_close"
                }
            ]
        },
        "quest_intro": {
            "greeting": "派对？哦，你是说Vortex Club那种？其实...我还没完全搞定场地许可。宿管大妈那边卡得很严。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "我去帮你搞定宿管",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:quest_accept",
                    "id": "btn_accept"
                },
                {
                    "label": "好吧，祝你好运",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_close"
                }
            ]
        },
        "quest_accept": {
            "greeting": "真的吗？如果你能搞定，你就是我的英雄！只要别让她看到你在抽烟或者乱扔垃圾就行。谢啦！",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "交给我吧",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_done"
                }
            ]
        }
    },
    "pose": "STANDING",
